  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, a line passes through the points \\((2, 10)\\) and \\((5, 1)\\). The line crosses the \\(x\\)-axis at the point \\((a, 0)\\). What is the value of \\(a\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "16/3"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Slope \\(= \\frac{1 - 10}{5 - 2} = -3\\).",
    "Through \\((5, 1)\\): \\(y = -3(x - 5) + 1 = -3x + 16\\).",
    "Set \\(y = 0\\): \\(x = \\frac{16}{3}\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\nm = Rational(1 - 10, 5 - 2)\nline = m*(x - 5) + 1\na = solve(line, x)[0]\nassert a == Rational(16, 3)\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [a]",
